{{define "subject"}}Your {{.Realm}} account is ready{{end}}

{{define "text"}}Hello{{if .Username}} {{.Username}}{{end}},

An administrator created an account for you on {{.Realm}}.
To start, choose your password with this link. It works once and expires in {{.ExpiresIn}}:

{{.ResetURL}}

If the link has expired, ask your administrator for a new one.
If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this e-mail: nobody can use
the account until a password is chosen with this link.
{{end}}

{{define "html"}}{{template "title" "Your account is ready"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello{{if .Username}} {{.Username}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">An administrator created an account for you on {{.Realm}}. To start, choose your password. The link below works once and expires in <strong>{{.ExpiresIn}}</strong>.</p>
{{template "button" (button .ResetURL "Choose my password")}}
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:13px;color:#59636e;">Button not working? Copy this address into your browser:<br><a href="{{.ResetURL}}" style="color:#1f6feb;word-break:break-all;">{{.ResetURL}}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">If the link has expired, ask your administrator for a new one.</p>
{{template "muted" "If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this e-mail: nobody can use the account until a password is chosen with this link."}}
{{end}}
